[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; REACH-1 (2026-09-19) — A CLOSED MOVABLE BOX. HollowShell.tscn plus a floor plate, so the object
; inside it is enclosed on all six sides by something the seeker can pick up.
;
; §5b's fifth planted case is "inside a closed movable box (allowed)", and it is the case that
; states the rule most sharply: EVERY eye ray hits this box first and not one of them reaches the
; object, and the hide is still legal — because the first hit is a MOVABLE prop. A layer 3 that
; only counted a direct line to the target would refuse the best hide in the game.
;
; Interior 0.84 x 0.54 x 0.84 (the floor plate eats 0.08 of the height), which clears a 0.44 m
; crate. See HollowShell.tscn's header for why the lid is the first collider.

